	(text_box "Project: ELS_Interface - NUCLEO-G474RE Shield\nPower: 12V Ext / USB (Diode-OR: D4, D5)\nIMPORTANT: Set NUCLEO JP5 jumper to 5-6 for External 12V power.\nUSB connection: Only for debugging/programming or 5V power.\nOpto-isolated outputs: U3, U4, U5 (PC817) for external loads.\nDisplay: J7 (8-pin, 2.00mm) - 12V power, UART RX/TX.\nIDC Interface: J5 (2x10) - 5V power, encoder, pushbuttons."
